9&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DOXyeVeZ2QEQ7kNvwHxPf1p&_nc_oc=AdrDgzYylOOdxrJ3VyjQ8VTQHfPcjsvvC3rNVsy1Qhw_1Ln_S6eOZt7xbqQ0jHRPDQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV0pLjqud9MDqmiav6SkJALO6oBCdFM_UyupbjpsMXRww&oe=6B0F1B96"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1527725392131713", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_1527725395465046_2961696855170049640_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JQ7aVak3K68Q7kNvwGzIhHl&_nc_oc=AdrSbHLPe1uCC7GLa7346HmwKQnpDBLpBf8cTrWEQa1uKlBpkighGOVfJNeMZ5NspUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVhhiy5WmPkTTqxUgJRFdJF7J6Xv-AdtEMyJWfUSwhCkQ&oe=6B0F01A5"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1380850910540095", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_1380850913873428_2843225670408242816_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o4YxuHFQsFEQ7kNvwGfAahi&_nc_oc=AdqDaZDD_zdj8R6QtUgirBCLia8vsWC0AzwRkftUfdhsdwRehS64rlIDxC5pv37DW40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXljYqlkTHcwZc7gLD1nn1YscMtml6DwBuLDVrBP17B1g&oe=6B0F22EA"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "850012641054321", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_850012644387654_8382873097328498055_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Se7gclqGElMQ7kNvwGzV2Ay&_nc_oc=AdqmwvUzzcqyAVYgC8ISLLDzWsS5bi9Z5byZnkSGqZOZvVbjjKwVR_QEdBaU2uwme2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWk_CuN_8MWBkCrllj-y-ry3ynXad5rv8hHeR7RGI4Elw&oe=6B0EF2A6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beat Blade", "keywords": ["Beat", "Blade", "Rhythm", "Music"], "long_description": "Unleash your inner rhythm master in Beat Blade, the ultimate high-energy VR rhythm action game!\n\nStep into an immersive arcade universe where music meets action. Dual-wield glowing energy blades and slice your way through a dynamic barrage of incoming notes, magical runes, and obstacles\u2014all synced perfectly to a pulse-pounding electronic soundtrack. Whether you are looking for a casual music experience or an intense arcade challenge, Beat Blade delivers a satisfying, full-body VR workout.\nKey Features:\nDual-Blade Action: Feel the rush as you slice, dodge, and conquer the rhythm with precise, physics-based blade controls.\n\nDiverse Track Selection: Choose from an expanding library of intense electronic tracks, with varied lengths and complex note layouts.\n\nCustomizable Runes: Personalize your arcade experience by selecting your target runes, ranging from mystical arcane rings to spooky ghosts and carved Halloween pumpkins.\n\n5 Difficulty Levels: Master your skills across five distinct settings\u2014Apprentice (for beginners), Mage, Sorcerer, Archmage, and Nightmare (for true rhythm game masters).\n\nHigh-Octane Visuals: Immerse yourself in a beautifully stylized neon-dark atmosphere with dynamic lighting and explosive particle effects.\n\nTrack Your Progress: Climb the ranks on each song with integrated performance grades from A to SS.\nAre you ready to test your reflexes and rule the leaderboard? Put on your headset, ignite your blades, and dominate the music in Beat Blade today!", "short_description": "Slice the beat! Dual-wield energy blades in this ultimate VR music rhythm game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lucidforgestudios.wixsite.com/lucid-forge-studios", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lucid Forge Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lucidforgestudios.wixsite.com/lucid-forge-studios", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}]